'''Wermals''' were a [[Sentience|sentient]] [[species]] that lived in [[the galaxy]]. They had one large [[eye]], [[nose]]-slits, [[Color|pink]] skin, and three [[heart]]s. They could live for well over a [[Standard century|century]]. [[Kedpin Shoklop]] was a Wermal from [[Werma Lesser]].<ref name="Rules of the Game" />

